{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8be8ab5b-db0e-11ef-a3e0-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8be8ab3d-db0e-11ef-9082-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"晉城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉城","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋城","resolved_place_entity_id":4712,"start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"add4f5f9-db0e-11ef-b576-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"西魏仍置南乡郡及淅州于此。隋初郡废。大业初，又改淅州为淅...","context_before":"...，遣军主庄丘黑进击南乡，拔之。旋复陷于后魏，又置南乡郡。","source_end_index":218,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"db339955-bc6f-524f-b9fc-ba05acea907b","source_start_index":189,"source_text":"梁普通六年，晋安王纲自雍州遣长史柳浑破魏南乡郡，寻复失之。"},{"context_after":"雕阳，或曰亦在州东。刘昫曰：唐武德四年，置平晋县，属邓州...","context_before":"晋城[在州东南。北魏置。","source_end_index":50,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"0ea68724-7213-5d74-9333-c23a6de000a8","source_start_index":12,"source_text":"梁普通六年，晋安王纲自襄阳遣司马董当门，破魏晋城，又破马圈、雕阳二城，是也。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"1春，正月，丙午，雍州刺史晉安王綱遣安北長史柳渾破魏南鄕郡；司馬董當門破魏晉城，庚戌，又破馬圈、彫陽二城。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月初一日丙午，梁雍州刺史晋安王萧纲派安北长史柳浑攻破北魏的南乡郡；司马董当门攻破北魏的晋城，正月初五日庚戌，又攻破马圈、彫阳二城。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，丙午，雍州刺史晋安王纲遣安北长史柳浑破魏南鄕郡；司马董当门破魏晋城，庚戌，又破马圈、雕阳二城。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":14209,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百五十 (梁紀六) / 高祖武皇帝六 / 六年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"add4f5ef-db0e-11ef-974d-a0d3651f611f","year_int":525},"tongjian_id":"add4f5ef-db0e-11ef-974d-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_co